  <AlienRace.AlienBackstoryDef Name="AvaliMaleWarTornSurvivor" Abstract="True">
    <title>War-torn survivor</title>
    <titleShort>War survivor</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] was hatched on a war-torn world where food was rare and other Avali had to fight for food. [PAWN_pronoun] never talks much and tries to avoid others in conversion because of the past life [PAWN_pronoun] tried to leave behind.</description>
