    <title>Lost egg</title>
    <titleShort>Lost egg</titleShort>
    <description>Forgotten and abandoned even before hatching, [PAWN_nameDef] never had a chance for a normal life. Growing up on [PAWN_possessive] own, [PAWN_pronoun] learned basic survival skills, at the cost of never learning to properly socialize. </description>
